2. WordPress Enumeration

Since the target was running WordPress, I used WPScan: wpscan --url blog.thm --enumerate vp
The scan identified several interesting findings:

WordPress version: 5.0
XML-RPC enabled
/wp-admin/ exposed
WordPress readme.html accessible
Directory listing enabled on /wp-content/uploads/
WP-Cron enabled
Theme: twentytwenty
No plugins were detected through passive enumeration. 
The most interesting finding was the old WordPress version: WordPress 5.0

